  data: {
    LLM: "Don't bid 100 unless you have the Jack (Valet) or at least the 9-Ace-10 covered. Remember you need to score 100 POINTS, not just win tricks.\n\nThe 'Fit': If your partner bids 80 Hearts and you hold the King and Queen, raise to 100! They likely have the Jack.\n\nBluff Bidding: Bidding a suit you don't have to push opponents higher, or to mislead them about your hand (risky). Also, 'Coinching' on a hunch that they are missing the 9.",
